                                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                                    Conexión desatendida mediante API REST o LTI 1.3 con plataformas autonómicas y de distrito: <em>EducaMadrid, Aules (C. Valenciana), Séneca (Andalucía), Moodle Educantabria, Canvas LMS o Google Classroom</em>.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">
                                <i class="fas fa-file-waveform text-xs"></i>
                            </div>
